## Output

Assemble the design as JSON matching `schemas/design.yaml`, then write it
in one call:

```bash
LOOM={{ input.__loom.runtime }}
WD={{ input.__loom.workdir }}
$LOOM output init "$WD" --task '{{ input.__task.id }}'
$LOOM output add "$WD" --task '{{ input.__task.id }}' \
    --set-json "design=$(cat /tmp/{{ input.name }}-design.json)"
```

Write scratch files only under `/tmp/` or the task workdir.
